; SAFFRA WELLS (sunspire.wells) - the caravan town at the oasis. Content frame, moved to Cell.origin
; by tools/shift_cell_content.py. The plaza pad is Area_wells_plaza; the caravanserai is Area_wells_caravanserai.
; Roads: north (0,-24..-8), west (-26..-8, -2), south (0, 4..24). Keep |x| > 4.5 clear of them.

