; CAMPAIGN (WR-spec1-13, 14, 15, 33, 34): the three well gauges, Rafe Sarn on the cistern lip and the grey pilgrims.
; The gauges are free-standing stones: the spec's oasis wall does not exist in this cell, so the slabs stand in a loose arc that
; the plaza's reading order (east, middle, west) follows. The plaza and the caravanserai are levelled pads, so the pilgrims need no tilt.

